# KJobs `src/` folder structure

Place code by **responsibility**, not file size. **`lib/` is not a catch-all** — reserve it for integrations and app infrastructure.

Product behavior (real auth vs mocked jobs) is in `docs/CONTEXT.md`. Do not treat `helper/meal.ts`, `helper/school.ts`, `helper/subscription*.ts`, `helper/course-module.ts`, or `helper/billing-invoice.ts` as KJobs code.

| Folder | Put here |
|--------|----------|
| `app/` | Next.js routes, layouts, page wiring |
| `components/` | React UI; feature subfolders |
| `services/` | `*-service.ts` only. Auth hits Laravel. Public jobs, seekers, saved jobs, applications, employer portal, and contact are mocked here |
| `fetch/` | Shared HTTP client |
| `types/` | TypeScript types/interfaces |
| `schemas/` | Zod schemas + validation |
| `enum/` | Shared enums |
| `constants/` | Static values only |
| `config/` | Domain UI lookup maps (status badges) |
| `helper/` | Domain helpers, toast, API mappers |
| `lib/` | NextAuth, `cn()`, form glue |
| `hooks/` | Shared React hooks |
| `store/` | Zustand slices |
| `data/` | Static catalogs (`public-jobs`, `public-seekers`, admin nav). Not a second API layer |
